## Soft HTTP server builtin (one-shot)
##
## http_serve_once_json_i64 is wired through sema / RIR / LLVM.
## End-to-end fiber pairing is gated by rt/tests/http_serve_once_smoke.c
## (size_echo_gates::http_serve_once_smoke_c).
##
## This example only proves the call lowers with correct ABI types.
## Port 0 is invalid so the runtime returns -1 without listening.

def main() -> i64
  let rc = http_serve_once_json_i64(0, "/api", 42)
  print_i64(rc)
  return 0
end
